+## V2.7 WS03D freshness truth
+
+The bounded freshness slice keeps five facts distinct:
+
+- `publishedAt`: first page publication date.
+- `updatedAt`: editorial/content update date; when publication exists it must not be earlier. Invalid ordering is rejected, never swapped or auto-corrected.
+- Fact/tool `patch` or version context: recorded game/content version, independent of dates.
+- Provenance `accessedAt`: when a source was checked/accessed, displayed as “Sources checked”; it does not establish an independent verification event.
+- `liveStatus.observedAt`: a dated live-state observation, independent of publication/update/source-access/version.
+
+Optional Page Inventory `liveStatus` is strict: `{ state: "not-live" }` declares no live-telemetry claim, not game/server offline status. `{ state: "observed-live", observedAt: "YYYY-MM-DD", sourceUrl: "https://...", evidenceNote: "private evidence pointer or note" }` records a source-backed observation. It renders “Observed live” with date and source link; evidenceNote remains private. Missing fields, non-HTTPS source and unknown state/fields are rejected. Omission remains valid and creates no live claim. Never infer live state from publication status, update date or patch. Do not add verifiedAt or invent real-time telemetry.
+
+The pure freshness projection exposes only public dates, optional recorded version context and public live-state/date/source. Wiki and editorial metadata preserve Published and Last updated separately; source access no longer claims “Last verified”. Static entity facts say “Recorded version”/recorded patch, not an unsupported current-game claim. Existing tool patch/formula wording remains bounded and unchanged. SEO datePublished/dateModified continue to use the original page publication/update authority, never source access or live observation.
+
+Latest updates is ordered deterministically by recorded page update date and the existing priority tie-break, with that basis shown adjacent to the title. Future Popular/Trending/Latest/Live labels must state explicit editorial or data provenance. Static labels may not imply telemetry they lack; an observed-live snapshot may not claim Live now, Currently live or Real-time. No synthetic live status is inserted into the canonical page inventory. Synthetic rendering proves only the mechanism, never actual game currency/live state or a real project's FR-01/FR-02 outcome.
+
+Actual project observation/evidence appropriateness remains Adaptation/Acceptance work. Safari proof is0, WS06A FULL BLOCKED, formal WS03 NOT_ACCEPTED, capability promotionNONE and release holdACTIVE. This slice does not authorize WS04A/WS05 or release work.
